<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<fo:root xmlns:fo="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">
  <fo:layout-master-set>
    <fo:simple-page-master master-name="A4"
                          page-width="210mm"
                          page-height="297mm"
                          margin="20mm">
      <fo:region-body/>
    </fo:simple-page-master>
  </fo:layout-master-set>

  <fo:page-sequence master-reference="A4">
    <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body">
      <fo:block font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="12pt">
        Line Breaking Test
      </fo:block>

      <fo:block space-before="12pt">
        This is a very long paragraph that should demonstrate proper line breaking behavior.
        The line breaking algorithm should handle this gracefully and break lines at appropriate
        word boundaries. It should not break in the middle of words unless absolutely necessary.
        This paragraph contains enough text to span multiple lines and demonstrate the line breaking
        capabilities of the layout engine. The Knuth-Plass algorithm should produce optimal breaks
        by considering the entire paragraph rather than making greedy line-by-line decisions.
      </fo:block>

      <fo:block space-before="12pt">
        Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious is a very long word that may need special handling.
        Pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis is even longer. Incomprehensibilities
        and antidisestablishmentarianism are also quite lengthy. The layout engine should
        handle these gracefully.
      </fo:block>
    </fo:flow>
  </fo:page-sequence>
</fo:root>
